    /// </summary>
    /// <remarks>
    /// <para>
    ///     <b> Authors: </b>
    ///     Haden Smith, USACE Risk Management Center, cole.h.smith@usace.army.mil
    /// </para>
    /// <para>
    /// Reference values are from scikit-learn 1.8.0 PCA(svd_solver="full") and R 4.4.3 prcomp, generated by
    /// docs/machine-learning/oracles/pca_oracle.py and pca_prcomp.R. The correlation basis is compared with
    /// scikit-learn fitted to the data divided by the sample standard deviation, which equals prcomp(scale. = TRUE).
    /// The two references agree to about 1e-14. The tolerances (1e-12 relative for variances, 1e-10 for axes and
    /// scores) allow for a different order of floating-point operations in the eigen-solver.
    /// </para>
    /// </remarks>
